# Phase 4 (IISC activation): bulk lattice data and harness-generated outputs
/test/CrossSections/5_IISC/
/test/legacy/
/test/9-1_IISC/**/XS/
/test/9-1_IISC/**/_runs/
/test/9-1_IISC/**/plot/
